    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/ceabbdce620c2d27c70c2f1352630c8e.poster.avif?t=1754231009\" width=616 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/ceabbdce620c2d27c70c2f1352630c8e.webm?t=1754231009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/ceabbdce620c2d27c70c2f1352630c8e.mp4?t=1754231009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When humanity as we know it is facing extermination from hostile alien civilizations...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Earth Federation needs a hero like you for a Captain capable of saving mankind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perks of the job include your pick of the cuties riding with your spaceship, too?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab yourself some beautiful alien babes whenever the feeling takes you, and put several millennia of wisdom to use while you discipline these monster girls in the profound ways of human sexuality!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Even aliens need loving too, right?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you had your fill of terrestrial girls already? Then it's time to look to outer space for signs of intelligent female life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle and capture gorgeous Mimic girls such as the Octopus and the Medusa to experience the ultimate pleasures of sex, beyond the boundaries of what is humanly possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/9243baa740ffa4a8edcabcfddfe308b1.poster.avif?t=1754231009\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/9243baa740ffa4a8edcabcfddfe308b1.webm?t=1754231009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/9243baa740ffa4a8edcabcfddfe308b1.mp4?t=1754231009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No place to hide from enemy fire? Offense is the best defense!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a stream of enemy forces and weave through a hail of bullets with intuitive and thrilling shoot 'em up gameplay. Deploy your girls' exclusive skills to wipe out the competition with a single blow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/5d06aad51d853c338f84c6b729b667e9.poster.avif?t=1754231009\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/5d06aad51d853c338f84c6b729b667e9.webm?t=1754231009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/5d06aad51d853c338f84c6b729b667e9.mp4?t=1754231009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mix and match lethal weaponry! Push those extraterrestrials to their limits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw up your weapons, defences, and microchips to strengthen your Cadettes against different enemies and their various skills and attributes. It's all up to you, Captain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510960/extras/afbf385a0d3256bdab8aff2639e41890.poster.avif?t=1754231009\" width=616 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com